    [
     1,
     "Hi!<br><br>Is there a way to suppress the x tick marks only? axis.ticks=theme_blank() does wipe out all tick marks and supplying scale_x_continuous(breaks=NULL, labels=NULL, minor_breaks=c(1,2,3)) does not work either. Any other option?<br>\n<br>Thanks,<br><br>Sebastian<br>\n"
    ]
   ]
  },
